VGC Coach

This repository is a fork of VGC Coach, originally published at
https://github.com/NoahJenkins/vgc-coach under the Apache License 2.0.

Upstream author: Noah Jenkins.

Source endpoint and TTL research was informed by VGC-Reporter
(https://github.com/felipesuarez-dev/VGC-Reporter), licensed under the MIT
License. No VGC-Reporter source code is vendored in this repository.

The bundled Sectigo Public Server Authentication CA DV R36 certificate is a
public intermediate certificate published by Sectigo for TLS chain completion.
Its SHA-256 fingerprint is pinned in tools/fetch_labmaus.py.
